{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47487","headline":"七言 四十六 · 吕岩","name":"七言 四十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞龙九五已升天，次第还当赤帝权。\n喜遇汞珠凝正午，幸逢铅母结重玄。\n狂猨自伏何须炼，野马亲调不着鞭。\n炼就一丸天上药，顿然心地永刚坚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}